{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]These are the people of the prov[Gm]ince who came up out of the [Eb]captivity [Bb]
[Eb]Nebuchadnezzar king [F]of Babylon [Bb]had carried them a[F]way
They re[Gm]turned to Jeru[Bb/D]salem and Ju[Eb]dah, each to his own town
With [F]Zerubbabel and Jeshua leading the [Bb]way
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F/A]When the [Gm]seventh month came the Israelites [Eb]were settled in their [Bb]towns
[F/A]The [Gm]people gathered as one in Jeru[Eb]salem to [F]stand
[Eb]Jeshua and Zerubbabel [Bb/D]set to work with their kinsmen
[Cm7]To rebuild the [Bb/D]altar of [Eb]the God of Is[F]rael
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
